_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-12T14:15:53Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:20Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108548","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108548.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108548.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Partial fix for #108432\r\n\r\nEliminates a class of bugs capable of crashing the editor.\r\n\r\nThe bug is the following:\r\n- A `Callable` is scheduled with an `Object *` argument\r\n- The argument `Object` is destructed\r\n- The callable is fired\r\n- The argument is not checked for having been destructed, which is fine for `RefCounted`, but incorrect for other `Object` subclasses\r\n- A crash occurs because the argument is assumed to be valid\r\n\r\nThe bug is exemplified by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108432. With this fix, it will start erroring instead of crashing, which is much better behavior.\r\nIt should also fix other 'random crashes' in similar situations.\r\n\r\n## Caveats\r\n\r\nThis fix introduces a regression for _all_ `Object *` taking functions using the call interfaces. In particular, it is a performance regression, putting more pressure on `ObjectDB`. However, I don't think there's a way to avoid this, other than major structural rewrites around `Object`. If we want to fix the crashes, we've got to take the performance regression.\r\n\r\nIt also may affect GDExtension interfaces.\r\nIt should be possible to introduce a separate pathway for GDExtension to avoid this check (and assume instead that given pointers are correct). However, I don't think this pathway exists yet (or perhaps they use `VariantCaster` instead of `VariantCasterAndValidate`? In that case, it would be all good. I didn't check yet).","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108548/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108548/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}